@startuml US061_SSD
title US061 - Add Air Transport Company Collaborator - SSD

actor "Backoffice Operator" as Operator
participant "SEM4PI Backoffice System" as System

Operator -> System : request to add a collaborator to an Air Transport Company
System --> Operator : present list of system users and list of Air Transport Companies

Operator -> System : select system user and Air Transport Company
System --> Operator : confirmation of created collaborator association

alt system user not found
    System --> Operator : show error (user not found)
else company not found
    System --> Operator : show error (company not found)
else collaborator already exists for user
    System --> Operator : show error (user already assigned as collaborator)
else not authenticated / not authorized
    System --> Operator : show access denied message
end

@enduml
